    {
      "id": "77082e64-82c1-4435-be04-6e767fdaba29",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "ArrayList<String> fruits = new ArrayList<>(List.of(\"Apple\", \"Banana\", \"Mango\", \"Orange\", \"Kiwi\"));\r\n\r\n//this is to get a part of the list: from index 1 (included) to index 4 (excluded)\r\n// Method: subList(fromIndex, toIndex)\r\n// What:   returns the part of the list from fromIndex (included) to toIndex (excluded)\r\n// Use:    to work with only a section of the list\r\nList<String> part = fruits.subList(1, 4);\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The sub list is: \" + part);",
