    {
      "id": "1643161c-5daa-4e3f-b497-e30e62626154",
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": "ArrayList<String> fruits = new ArrayList<>(List.of(\"apple\", \"banana\", \"mango\"));\r\n\r\n//this is to change every item with the same rule\r\n// Method: replaceAll(rule)\r\n// What:   changes every item using the rule (a lambda) you give it\r\n// Use:    to update all values at once, e.g. make every name UPPERCASE\r\nfruits.replaceAll(fruit -> fruit.toUpperCase());\r\nSystem.out.println(\"The list is: \" + fruits);",
      "metadata": {
